    "type": "game",
    "name": "Struggler",
    "steam_appid": 3031010,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a dark 2-like game where you will play as an Avenger with superpowers. Your country is completely conquered and destroyed by another country, and you are one of the few survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were subjected to biological experiments by scientists from a hostile country, unexpectedly gaining superpowers and escaping. As you grow, you decide to return all the torture you have suffered to the enemy and kill every enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can learn talents, assign attribute points, select initial attributes, hire warriors, learn superpowers, learn characteristics, equip and set gems, choose movement routes, fight against different monsters or destroy enemy cities, and slaughter enemy civilians.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bloody and violent 3D dark style revenge adventure game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Core Features]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 Bloody Revenge Journey - Play as concentration camp survivor Emiya Jackson and embark on the path of mutant revenge after the fall of the homeland</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 Ultimate destruction experience - can freely destroy objects in the scene, and engage in exhilarating battles where enemies explode and scatter when they die</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 Dark Open World - Sandbox gameplay that integrates Dark 2-like equipment system and realistic item circulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 Moral Decision System - Free choice of just or evil path, enduring the suppressive punishment brought by crime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 Comic narrative technique - unfolds a thrilling revenge plot through a single page comic format</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Combat System]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 Realistic weapon feedback - Different attack methods bring differentiated physical effects such as amputation and flying</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 Talent Building Gameplay - The Seven Original Sins correspond to different growth paths, paired with hundreds of skill combinations (choose skills and skill evolution)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 Attendant Management System - Recruit unique mercenaries, but be aware of their dementia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every swing of the knife is accompanied by bloodshed, and every choice leads to a different ending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Urban stronghold</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPC behavior changes in different time periods (work/rest/battle)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Dynamic Evil System - NPCs will respond truthfully to your atrocities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evil system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crime value is divided into explicit/implicit levels-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The intensity of police pursuit increases with star rating-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massacre can destroy all buildings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Quality grading (ordinary \u2192 dark gold)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Random generation of entries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Gem inlay changes skill effects or equipment attributes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The influence of the choice of the seven deadly sins constrained by original sin:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Initial attributes of the character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Equipment entry tendency</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Global binding relationship</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a dark 2-like game where you will play as an Avenger with superpowers. Your country is completely conquered and destroyed by another country, and you are one of the few survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were subjected to biological experiments by scientists from a hostile country, unexpectedly gaining superpowers and escaping. As you grow, you decide to return all the torture you have suffered to the enemy and kill every enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can learn talents, assign attribute points, select initial attributes, hire warriors, learn superpowers, learn characteristics, equip and set gems, choose movement routes, fight against different monsters or destroy enemy cities, and slaughter enemy civilians.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bloody and violent 3D dark style revenge adventure game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Core Features]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 Bloody Revenge Journey - Play as concentration camp survivor Emiya Jackson and embark on the path of mutant revenge after the fall of the homeland</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 Ultimate destruction experience - can freely destroy objects in the scene, and engage in exhilarating battles where enemies explode and scatter when they die</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 Dark Open World - Sandbox gameplay that integrates Dark 2-like equipment system and realistic item circulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 Moral Decision System - Free choice of just or evil path, enduring the suppressive punishment brought by crime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 Comic narrative technique - unfolds a thrilling revenge plot through a single page comic format</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Combat System]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 Realistic weapon feedback - Different attack methods bring differentiated physical effects such as amputation and flying</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 Talent Building Gameplay - The Seven Original Sins correspond to different growth paths, paired with hundreds of skill combinations (choose skills and skill evolution)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 Attendant Management System - Recruit unique mercenaries, but be aware of their dementia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every swing of the knife is accompanied by bloodshed, and every choice leads to a different ending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Urban stronghold</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPC behavior changes in different time periods (work/rest/battle)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Dynamic Evil System - NPCs will respond truthfully to your atrocities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evil system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crime value is divided into explicit/implicit levels-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The intensity of police pursuit increases with star rating-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massacre can destroy all buildings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Quality grading (ordinary \u2192 dark gold)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Random generation of entries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Gem inlay changes skill effects or equipment attributes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The influence of the choice of the seven deadly sins constrained by original sin:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Initial attributes of the character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Equipment entry tendency</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Global binding relationship</p>",
    "short_description": "This is a dark game that includes regular monster killing, treasure dropping, gem setting, strategy matching skills and talents, collecting special items, battle flags, destructible environments, and other elements. It can also be played in city strongholds to eliminate crime and police.",
